<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DRAW IN TOUR MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA DRAW IN TOUR MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>TAUNTON, England 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somerset drew with Australia as rain prevented play on the last day of their four day match on Monday. Scores: Somerset 284 and 147-3 (R.Turner 65 not out), Australia 323 (B.Julian 71, S.Waugh 62; A.Caddick 5-54).</p>
